WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.520 --> 00:00:06.437
Scry Sync lives in your system tray and
keeps one folder synced with a Scry project.

2
00:00:07.007 --> 00:00:13.863
Open its icon to see the project, the
folder, and a plain status line.

3
00:00:14.433 --> 00:00:20.124
Anything that needs attention is listed in
words, with one action per row.

4
00:00:20.694 --> 00:00:25.915
Pause stops syncing for a while, and the
gear opens Settings.
